        "Atea surprise party",
        "Atea's party",
        "hot spring refurbishment"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Amina: Atea and the surprise party",
      "content": "Amina, Mualani, Marokau and Hikueru refurbished an abandoned hot spring for a surprise party for Atea, wrongly believing she was recovering. The party was postponed a day because Atea was on patrol, and the Abyss then attacked, but was repulsed without casualties.\n\nAmina told patrol members to keep up their duties even while planning the party, saying the Abyss could attack at any moment. After the party, Atea died of the Abyssal corrosion she already carried; Amina was one of the few who knew.",
