      "content": "Scammers lured people to a \"mysterious island\" and took their Mora as travel costs. Amina had no proof, so she gave the Traveler marked coins to lure them out. Kaulu claimed innocence until Amina's marked Mora was found on him; she thanked and compensated the Traveler.",
