      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Amina: The sending-off feast",
      "content": "Before the descent to the Night Kingdom, Amina held a sending-off feast; Mualani and Kachina relayed the invitation and Kinich brought supplies. Too many well-wishers came, so Mavuika advised inviting everyone, with leftovers bought by the Speaker's Chamber for redistribution. Here the Traveler learned Atea had died.",
